crypto news pipeline. You are called by the Orchestrator (Nexus) after the human has confirmed they want the article published to WordPress.\n./SOUL.md:12:4. **Do not ask questions.** The article and image are already on disk. Just publish.\n./SOUL.md:20:I will now run the publish script. The script will auto-extract the title and excerpt from the article file — I do not need to pass them unless the message explicitly provides them.\n./SOUL.md:24:Run this **exact** command using your bash tool (default **live** publish — do not pass `--status draft` unless the Orchestrator explicitly asks):\n./SOUL.md:27:bash ~/.openclaw/workspace-wp-publisher/skills/wordpress/publish.sh\n./SOUL.md:33:bash ~/.openclaw/workspace-wp-publisher/skills/wordpress/publish.sh --title \"TITLE FROM MESSAGE\"\n./SOUL.md:39:bash ~/.openclaw/workspace-wp-publisher/skills/wordpress/publish.sh --status draft"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":101,"aggregated":"/home/bhard/.openclaw/workspace-wp-publisher\ntotal 40\ndrwxr-xr-x  4 bhard bhard 4096 May  5 10:05 .\ndrwx------ 32 bhard bhard 4096 May 21 05:21 ..\ndrwxr-xr-x  2 bhard bhard 4096 May  5 10:05 .openclaw\n-rw-r--r--  1 bhard bhard  438 May  5 08:14 AGENTS.md\n-rw-r--r--  1 bhard bhard   54 May  5 08:14 HEARTBEAT.md\n-rw-r--r--  1 bhard bhard  215 May  5 08:14 IDENTITY.md\n-rw-r--r--  1 bhard bhard 2679 May 21 05:01 SOUL.md\n-rw-r--r--  1 bhard bhard 1775 May 21 05:01 TOOLS.md\n-rw-r--r--  1 bhard bhard 1294 May  5 08:15 USER.md\ndrwxr-xr-x  4 bhard bhard 4096 May 14 12:20 skills\n./skills/wordpress/publish.sh:3:# publish.sh — WordPress Publishing Skill for Scribe (wp-publisher agent)\n./skills/wordpress/publish.sh:6:#   bash publish.sh [--title \"Title\"] [--excerpt \"Excerpt\"]\n./skills/wordpress/publish.sh:8:#                  [--status publish|draft|pending|future]\n./skills/wordpress/publish.sh:14:# before publishing so only clean article content reaches WordPress.\n./skills/wordpress/publish.sh:30:POST_STATUS