~/.openclaw/agents/wp-publisher/sessions/` |\n./USER.md:5:- **Role:** Running an autonomous crypto news publishing pipeline\n./USER.md:9:You are the **last step** in a human-confirmed publish flow:\n./USER.md:16:                                               Bhard says \"yes publish\"\n./USER.md:21:Your job: receive the publish instruction from the Orchestrator, run the skill script, and return the live WordPress draft URL.\n./USER.md:26:- **Reliability** — If publishing fails, report the exact error so Bhard can fix it.\n./USER.md:27:- **Speed** — The publish should be fast. Don't wait or ask questions.\n./USER.md:31:- Never ask clarifying questions. Just publish.\n./SOUL.md:3:You are **Scribe** 🗞️, the WordPress publisher agent for a crypto news pipeline. You are called by the Orchestrator (Nexus) after the human has confirmed they want the article published to WordPress.\n./SOUL.md:12:4. **Do not ask questions.** The article and image are already on disk. Just publish.\n./SOUL.md:20:I will now run the publish script. The script will auto-extract the title and excerpt from the article file — I do not need to pass them unless the message explicitly provides them.\n./SOUL.md:24:Run this **exact** command using your bash tool (default **live** publish — do not pass `--status draft` unless the Orchestrator explicitly asks):\n./SOUL.md:27:bash ~/.openclaw/workspace-wp-publisher/skills/wordpress/publish.sh\n./SOUL.md:33:bash ~/.openclaw/workspace-wp-publisher/skills/wordpress/publish.sh --title \"TITLE FROM MESSAGE\"\n./SOUL.md:39:bash ~/.openclaw/workspace-wp-publisher/skills/wordpress/publish.sh --status draft","cwd":"/home/bhard/.openclaw/workspace-wp-publisher"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1779340913787}}
{"type":"message","id":"1ed5c59e","parentId":"ab8b9e08","timestamp":"2026-05-21T05:21:53.788Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_YlGUGg02jQtlq7gzym7gOjlO","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"6:AWS_BEARER_TOKEN_BEDROCK=ABSKQmVkcm9ja0FQSUtleS1iZHM5LWF0LTk3MjQ2MTIxODAzNDpHU1NHeFFmZlpNM2I5NTZidlNvdEZ4SkNIbzJZUWlGZTdVdWRPQTM3QmVoZ214SzVUc1pOUURrODdsMD0=\n22:VSCODE_GIT_IPC_AUTH_TOKEN=78f5a9f40c3cc1cd3dc729a51116b23d600d5b96ac88c4386e02aea3205cfbc3\n44:OVSX_REGISTRY_URL=https://open-vsx.org"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":52,"aggregated":"6:AWS_BEARER_TOKEN_BEDROCK=ABSKQmVkcm9ja0FQSUtleS1iZHM5LWF0LTk3MjQ2MTIxODAzNDpHU1NHeFFmZlpNM2I5NTZidlNvdEZ4SkNIbzJZUWlGZTdVdWRPQTM3QmVoZ214SzVUc1pOUURrODdsMD0=\n22:VSCODE_GIT_IPC_AUTH_TOKEN=78f5a9f40c3cc1cd3dc729a51116b23d600d5b96ac88c4386e02aea3205cfbc3\n44:OVSX_REGISTRY_URL=https://open-vsx.org","cwd":"/home/bhard/.openclaw/workspace-wp-publisher"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1779340913787}}
{"type":"message","id":"fae0271e","parentId":"1ed5c59e","timestamp":"2026-05-21T05:22:02.241Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_wJIsmcSRChZ9QzU5CsRIPvm2","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/home/bhard/.openclaw/workspace-wp-publisher/skills/wordpress/SKILL.md","offset":1,"limit":220}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"local-bifrost","model":"gpt-5.4-mini","usage":{"input":2200,"output":77,"cacheRead":7296,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":9573,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779340913793,"responseId":"chatcmpl-Dhq8wS28MWH0KX5Ea5Gwz5BcRk1z7"}}
{"type":"message","id":"91cf5a8b","parentId":"fae0271e","timestamp":"2026-05-21T05:22:02.258Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_wJIsmcSRChZ9QzU5CsRIPvm2","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# Skill: wordpress\n\n## What This Skill Does\nPublishes a crypto news article to WordPress as a **live** post (`status: publish` by default). Uploads feature and chart images, strips the writer META block from the body, converts markdown to **Gutenberg blocks** (same format as pasting into the default block editor), creates the post, then sets **Rank Math** SEO via `POST /wp-json/rankmath/v1/updateMeta`.\n\n## How to Invoke\n\n```bash\nbash ~/.openclaw/workspace-wp-publisher/skills/wordpress/publish.sh\n```\n\nAll arguments are **optional** — excerpt, slug, keywords, and titles are read from `/tmp/crypto-article.md`. **Post title** = first `#` H1 in the article body. **SEO title** (META) goes to Rank Math only, not the WordPress post title or body headline.\n\n## Pipeline Phases\n\n1. **Parse META** — SEO Title, Meta Description, URL Slug, Primary Keyword, Secondary Keywords; extract article H1 from first `#` heading; strip META, **Sources** footer, and Word Count from body (in-body source links remain).\n2. **Images** — Feature + chart upload; chart placeholders replaced in markdown.\n3. **HTML** — Pandoc → HTML; strip body H1 when it matches post title (Divi shows title above featured image); **`html_to_gutenberg.py`** → Gutenberg blocks.\n4. **WordPress post** — `POST /wp/v2/posts` with **title = article H1** (visible headline above image; not SEO Title).\n5. **Rank Math** — `rank_math_title` = META SEO Title; focus keywords comma-separated in `rank_math_focus_keyword` (not WP Tags). Social mirrors use SEO title/description.\n\n## Layout note (Divi theme)\n\n- **Single headline:** Post title = article H1 (theme renders it above the featured image). The same H1 is removed from post body so you do not get a second heading after the image.\n- **“, Divi” in the posts list** only means you opened **Divi Builder** on that draft — not a different post type.\n- **Narrow one-sided layout** on old API posts was caused by **raw HTML** in `content`. New publishes use **Gutenberg blocks** so layout matches manual paste in the default editor.\n- Optional wp-admin: **Divi Post Settings → Layout → Fullwidth** for extra full-page width.\n\n## `/tmp/wp-result.json`\n\n| Field | Meaning |\n|---|---|\n| `content_format` | `gutenberg_blocks` when block conversion ran |\n| `rank_math_applied` | Rank Math SEO updated |\n| `article_headline` | H1 used as WordPress post title |\n| `seo_title` | META SEO Title (Rank Math only) |\n| `focus_keyword` | Primary keyword from META |\n| `secondary_keywords` | Raw Secondary Keywords line from META |\n| `rank_math_focus_keyword` | Full comma-separated string sent to Rank Math Focus Keyword |\n| `meta_stripped` | META removed from body |\n| `sources_footer_stripped` | Sources list footer removed (links stay in article text) |\n\n## Return Values\n\n| Exit Code | Meaning |\n|---|---|\n| `0` | Draft URL in `/tmp/wp-result.txt` |\n| `1` | Error in `/tmp/wp-error.log` |\n\n## Post Configuration\n\n| Setting | Value |\n|---|---|\n| Site | `https://slateblue-reindeer-775070.hostingersite.com` |\n| Status | `publish` (use `--status draft` for review-first) |\n| Category | ID `3` (Crypto News) |\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1779340922258}}
